{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/828362-so-about-spoofing","id":828362,"title":"So, About Spoofing...","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Demon: The Descent"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-02-11T12:51:51-08:00","id":828362,"title":"So, About Spoofing...","content":"I still don't think I've ever gotten a satisfactory answer to this question, but what happens when a Demon is subjected to a detrimental supernatural effect that is only able to target non-supernaturals? If they remain unaffected by it then they are, by implication, a supernatural of some stripe. So first my first question is, are they even allowed to attempt to spoof such a power, or Is it too indirect to count? My second question is if they <i>can</i> spoof it, what happens? Does the ability then affect them as if they were human? Does it 'register' as if it affected them normally but not actually do anything? What?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2309-ashenrogue","name":"Ashenrogue","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2309_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1388"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-11T13:00:02-08:00","id":828368,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Ashenrogue</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/828362-so-about-spoofing#post828362\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I still don't think I've ever gotten a satisfactory answer to this question, but what happens when a Demon is subjected to a detrimental supernatural effect that is only able to target non-supernaturals? If they remain unaffected by it then they are, by implication, a supernatural of some stripe.</div> </div> </div> </div>Or, y'know, the power failed. There's not a lot of automatically-successful mortal-only effects and Cover already acts as a Supernatural Tolerance trait for the purposes of resistance even before spoofing.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","name":"Satchel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar111_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9828"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-11T13:07:45-08:00","id":828375,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Satchel</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/828362-so-about-spoofing?p=828368#post828368\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Or, y'know, the power failed. There's not a lot of automatically-successful mortal-only effects and Cover already acts as a Supernatural Tolerance trait for the purposes of resistance even before spoofing.</div> </div> </div> </div>Yeah, but some powers you know you succeeded on, and that they wen't off as they were supposed to. Which is why I bring it up, because I know at least for me, it will come up. So assuming whatever ability is being used goes off, even despite the supernatural tolerance, what happens?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2309-ashenrogue","name":"Ashenrogue","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2309_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1388"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-11T13:41:52-08:00","id":828413,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Ashenrogue</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/828362-so-about-spoofing#post828362\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I still don't think I've ever gotten a satisfactory answer to this question, but what happens when a Demon is subjected to a detrimental supernatural effect that is only able to target non-supernaturals? If they remain unaffected by it then they are, by implication, a supernatural of some stripe. So first my first question is, are they even allowed to attempt to spoof such a power, or Is it too indirect to count? My second question is if they <i>can</i> spoof it, what happens? Does the ability then affect them as if they were human? Does it 'register' as if it affected them normally but not actually do anything? What?</div> </div> </div> </div>Huh. I actually wrote up a merit to cover just this in a concrete manner.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Malkydel: &quot;And the Machine dictated; let there be adequate illumination.&quot;<br /> Yossarian: &quot;And lo, it was optimal.&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0","name":"Vent0","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7212_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5184"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-11T13:49:59-08:00","id":828420,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Vent0</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/828362-so-about-spoofing?p=828413#post828413\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Huh. I actually wrote up a merit to cover just this in a concrete manner.</div> </div> </div> </div>Oh? Mind sharing it? And if you had to come up with a merit I'll assume there's nothing official that covers such things? I wasn't sure if it had been brought up and answered previously, or if it were hidden away in some dark corner of one of the books and I just didn't know about it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2309-ashenrogue","name":"Ashenrogue","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2309_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1388"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-11T15:51:10-08:00","id":828478,"title":"","content":"There's always the option of if said spoof succeeded, the effects of the power can be faked, as to not out the Demon by implication. It's just unfortunately one of those edge cases.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1462-xenesis","name":"Xenesis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1462_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-11T18:40:26-08:00","id":828525,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Ashenrogue</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/828362-so-about-spoofing?p=828420#post828420\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Oh? Mind sharing it? And if you had to come up with a merit I'll assume there's nothing official that covers such things? I wasn't sure if it had been brought up and answered previously, or if it were hidden away in some dark corner of one of the books and I just didn't know about it.</div> </div> </div> </div>Link to post: <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/786694-homebrew-demon-merits?p=802261#post802261\">http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/m...261#post802